Package: hcesfort
Title: Apparent Micronutrient Intake and Food Fortification Scenarios from
    Household Consumption and Expenditure Surveys
Version: 0.0.0.9000
Authors@R:
    person("Maicel E.", "Monzón-Pérez", role = c("aut", "cre", "cph"),
           email = "21109332+maicel1978@users.noreply.github.com")
Description: Estimates apparent micronutrient intake per adult equivalent
    from Household Consumption and Expenditure Surveys (HCES), models food
    fortification scenarios, and estimates the risk of inadequate intake
    under the complex design of the survey. The core is survey-agnostic:
    surveys, food composition tables and national standards are supplied
    by the user as tables that satisfy documented data contracts, and
    every exclusion is counted in an audit log returned with the result.
